\n\
required: false — so I can choose to discard 0, 1, or 2 cards.\n\
\n\
But the card Tersa Lightshatter’s ability says: *\"When Tersa Lightshatter enters the battlefield, discard two cards.\"* So it’s mandatory.\n\
\n\
required: false might be a UI quirk — the ability itself is required.\n\
\n\
